        -:  737:    /**
        -:  738:     * Provide the draw object specific comparison called by the == and < operators.
        -:  739:     *
        -:  740:     * The base object sort order which always proceeds the derived object sort order
        -:  741:     * is as follows:
        -:  742:     *      - Symbol alternate part (DeMorgan) number.
        -:  743:     *      - Symbol part number.
        -:  744:     *      - KICAD_T enum value.
        -:  745:     *      - Result of derived classes comparison.
        -:  746:     *
        -:  747:     * @note Make sure you call down to #SCH_ITEM::compare before doing any derived object
        -:  748:     *       comparisons or you will break the sorting using the symbol library file format.
        -:  749:     *
        -:  750:     * @param aOther A reference to the other #SCH_ITEM to compare the arc against.
        -:  751:     * @param aCompareFlags The flags used to perform the comparison.
        -:  752:     *
        -:  753:     * @return An integer value less than 0 if the object is less than \a aOther object,
        -:  754:     *         zero if the object is equal to \a aOther object, or greater than 0 if the
        -:  755:     *         object is greater than \a aOther object.
        -:  756:     */
        -:  757:    virtual int compare( const SCH_ITEM& aOther, int aCompareFlags = 0 ) const;
